cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use rnaseq-flow in your work, please cite it as below.
title: rnaseq-flow
abstract: >-
  A modular bulk RNA-seq analysis pipeline built with Nextflow DSL2. It takes
  raw FASTQ files through quality control, alignment or quantification,
  differential expression, alternative splicing, fusion detection and
  functional enrichment, and aggregates the results into interactive HTML
  reports. The aligner and the analysis stages are selectable, references can
  be supplied directly or downloaded and indexed by built-in helper workflows,
  and every published figure ships the script that drew it.
type: software
